stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Loading: mount
  Loading --> AllTerms: valid response without retained key
  Loading --> SelectedTerm: valid response with retained key
  Loading --> Error: rejected or malformed response
  Error --> Loading: explicit retry
  AllTerms --> SelectedTerm: choose existing key
  SelectedTerm --> AllTerms: choose All terms
  SelectedTerm --> Loading: refresh
  AllTerms --> Loading: Compare or refresh
  AllTerms --> AllTerms: open or close coverage
  SelectedTerm --> SelectedTerm: open or close coverage
  Loading --> Loading: ignore stale response
  Loading --> Disposed: parent clears session
  AllTerms --> Disposed: dispose
  SelectedTerm --> Disposed: dispose
  Error --> Disposed: dispose
  Disposed --> [*]
